## Node identity and runtime flags for mcl_warden.
-name ${MCL_NODE_NAME}@${MCL_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${MCL_COOKIE}

+K true

## Async thread pool: the sensor does real file I/O on the auth log.
+A 16

## The tarpit can hold tens of thousands of idle connections; lift the process
## and port ceilings so a flood fills the tarpit up to its cap instead of
## hitting a VM limit first.
+P 1048576
+Q 1048576
